    <!-- Home tips -->
    <string name="home_tips">
        "Great agents get great roles: start your prompt by defining WHO the model is.\nGive the model an exit: tell it exactly how the answer should look.\nOne prompt, one goal — split complex tasks into a chain of prompts.\nShow, don\'t tell: add one example of the output you expect.\nTest in the Lab and iterate — a prompt is a draft until it proves itself."
    </string>
